%I A400758 #21 Oct 22 2026 18:12:43
%S A400758 1,2,4,8,17,38,93,244,691,2080,6582,21628,73133,252596,886682,3151696,
%T A400758 11314821,40952724,149235713,546997220,2015060589,7456235100,
%U A400758 27699224828,103265927386,386225264545,1448748264550,5448857132105,20543938495012,77632721065445
%N A400758 Number of equivalence classes of Dyck paths of semilength n+1 up to permutation of primitive components, and permutations and reflection of nested primitive components.
%C A400758 Equivalence classes of Dyck paths under:
%C A400758 * Order of appearance of primitive components.
%C A400758 * Order of appearance of primitive components inside primitive components.
%C A400758 * Reflection of primitive components inside primitive components.
%H A400758 Alois P. Heinz, <a href="/A400758/b400758.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1670</a>
%H A400758 Y. Binyamin and E. C. Kniffen, <a href="https://yoavbinyamin.github.io/pyranim_iso_preprint.pdf">Enumerating Pyranim Isomorphisms</a>, preprint, 2026.
%F A400758 G.f.: U(x)/(1-x), where U(x) is the g.f. for A005217.
%e A400758 a(3) = 8:
%e A400758   UUUUDDDD
%e A400758   UUUDUDDD
%e A400758   UUUDDUDD, UUDUUDDD
%e A400758   UUUDDDUD, UDUUUDDD
%e A400758   UUDUDUDD
%e A400758   UUDUDDUD, UDUUDUDD, UUDDUUDD
%e A400758   UUDDUDUD, UDUUDDUD, UDUDUUDD
%e A400758   UDUDUDUD
%e A400758   for a total of 8 up to equivalence.
%o A400758 (PARI)
%o A400758 EulerTS(p)={my(n=serprec(p,x)-1); exp(x*Ser(dirmul(Vec(serchop(p,1),-n), vector(n,k,1/k)))) }
%o A400758 seq(n) = my(A=O(x*x^n)); Vec(EulerTS((1 + 2*x - sqrt((1 - 4*x)*(1 - 4*x^2) + A))/(4*sqrt(1 - 4*x^2 + A)))/(1 - x)) \\ _Andrew Howroyd_, Oct 15 2026
%Y A400758 Partial sums of A005217.
%K A400758 nonn,new
%O A400758 0,2
%A A400758 _Yoav Binyamin_, Oct 05 2026
